\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">신재생에너지(태양광, 연료전지, 2차전지), 탄소저감 에너지, 고도 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">물처리, 그린수송</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">시스템, 첨단 그린도시 첨단융합산업분야의 소재</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">/부품, 기기/장치 활용 등 최적화 관련 신기술 개발</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000 1px solid; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; WIDTH: 118.94pt; HEIGHT: 46.86pt; COLOR: #000; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000 1px solid\" valign=\"center\" cols=\"1\" rows=\"1\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">IT융복합분야</span></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; WIDTH: 327.36pt; HEIGHT: 46.86pt; COLOR: #000; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000 1px solid\" valign=\"center\" cols=\"1\" rows=\"1\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">방송통신융합산업, IT융합시스템, 로봇 응용, 신소재-나노 융합, </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">바이오제약(자원)-의료기기, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">글로벌 헬스케어, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">LED 응용 분야의</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 소재/부품, 기기/장치 활용 등 최적화 관련 신기술 개발</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>나. 세부내용 :</strong></font></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">[붙임 1] 참조</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">다. 지원규모 및 사업기간</font></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp; 1) 지원규모 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMIL